---@field offset? number Identifies the starting point to return hits from a result set. Can be used as an alternative to the page parameter.
---@field group_by? string You can aggregate search results into groups or buckets by specify one or more `group_by` fields. Separate multiple fields with a comma. To group on a particular field, it must be a faceted field.
