---@field hidden_hits? string A list of records to unconditionally hide from search results. A list of `record_id`s to hide. Eg: to hide records with IDs 123 and 456, you'd specify `123,456`. You could also use the Curation feature to override search results based on rules. Curations are applied first, followed by `pinned_hits` and finally `hidden_hits`.
